-- IrisTaming.lua -- WOLF TAMING PROTOTYPE (I.R.I.S. Phase 2)
-- Two paths, one ending (design locked 2026-07-07):
--   COMBAT:   weaken to the floor (can't die) -> it YIELDS (window timer) -> approach SHEATHED
--             -> offer food / hand out (TAME key) -> pact.
--   APPROACH: no combat -- move slow, stop when it startles, build familiarity across visits.
--             Failure never deletes progress: startle -> warn -> disengage (walks, never darts).
-- V1 stubs (flagged in UI): food check is a toggle (inventory research pending), follow is
-- warp-follow (native nav research pending), tells are notify-lines (in-world poses later).
