                -- catch_active only sees CREATURE catches -- that's why 28aa still broke in-hand
                -- HANDS FIRST: a genuine carry outranks everything (picking it up AT the nest
                -- must never fight the home pin)
                -- IN-NEST = SAFE + ANCHORED, until HANDS take it (image 67: the mother smashed her
                -- own egg; then a wing PUNT beat the old 2.5s pin window and 12m bubble -- so no
                -- radius, no timer: the never-yet-carried nest egg is pinned and immune, PERIOD.
                -- Wings, stomps, kicks: nothing moves it but a deliberate pickup.
                -- ⭐ INCUBATING egg HOLDS its ledger spot, EVERY frame, while the player isn't
                -- carrying it. The egg is a physics ROCK: camp props (and just terrain) shove it and
                -- it ROLLS AWAY (image 102 -- found it 10m off in the grass). This must run
