                -- sweep had not resolved a body on THAT tick, the gift was disqualified forever.
                -- Her log is the proof: `offering REFUSED ... witnessed=false` at 01:00:51.991, then
                -- `soars-near hint: ch253000_00_77 at 494m` at 01:00:54.139. The griffin was there --
                -- we asked two seconds too early and never asked again.
                -- ⇒ keep asking while the corpse is still fresh. A griffin who streams in, or simply
                -- resolves a tick later, still counts as having found the gift -- which is the thing
